@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_TOKEN

# Target examples; routes are learner work and UUIDs must be replaced.

### Request shipment (carrier calls must use a local mock)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: shipment-example-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"destination":"12 Example Street, Test City"}

### Negative signature case: must return 401 and change nothing
POST {{base}}/api/v1/carrier-events
X-Webhook-Timestamp: 0
X-Webhook-Signature: v1=invalid
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","shipmentId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","sequence":1,"status":"DISPATCHED"}
